#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kaddressbook; is the main address book application for &kde;; it enables you "
"to manage your contacts efficiently and comfortably. Since it is based on the "
"kabc library it supports resources, which can be used to load and save your "
"contacts to many different locations &mdash; not just the local file system, "
"but also to LDAP servers and SQL databases."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The user interface is similar to MS Outlook and it supports different views for "
"to represent the contact data differently; it also provides an incremental "
"search over all fields and a jump button bar to quickly access single entries. "
"Since the underlying kabc library uses the vCard format (specified in RFC 2426) "
"as its default storage medium, &kaddressbook; mainly reflects the supported "
"entry fields in its graphical user interface."
msgstr ""

